abstract: >-
  Numerical data and computational codes supporting the morphological
  phase diagram, initial-condition robustness analysis, class 2-to-3
  morphological transition boundary, Hopf-bifurcation comparison,
  and linear diffusive-mode analysis of the Gray-Scott
  reaction-diffusion model.

